Hi Ken,

Many thanks for this. I'm going to give it a try this afternoon. Also thanks for letting me know about the pre-release version of unmarked on Github. I use a handmade piFun for dependent double observer sampling that Richard helped with a while back:

# Create piFun (from R. Chandler)
depDoubleObs <- function(p) {
  M <- nrow(p)
  pi <- matrix(NA, M, 2)
  pi[,1] <- p[,1]
  pi[,2] <- p[,2]*(1-p[,1])
  return(pi)
}

Do you know if this piFun will work with the pre-release version on GitHub? And do you happen to know if there's an ETA for this version being available on CRAN?

Thanks again!

Mark

