Hi Carly,

I made some quick and dirty hacks to Dan's original R scripts to re-enable parallel processing (attached, see comments in files for changes). It seems to work for me.

Running in parallel might not help that much in your situation given how long it is taking. Maybe test a small number of sims (say 5-10) to see how long it takes to extrapolate the expected runtime for the full run?

Ken

