hi Gwili,
 I would say that LCCode has too many levels and perhaps some of them are not present in the data set. In any case, I would say that "too many parameters" is the basic problem here and the only solution is to simplify the model -- at a minimum you need to remove the levels which are not represented in the data set, if that is the case.
regards
andy

