Subject: log or log10 transform predictor variable?
Message-ID: <-hhSbqnYNjU.JeYkq0H4AgAJ@unmarked.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/unmarked/c/-hhSbqnYNjU/m/JeYkq0H4AgAJ>
